# Lunduke Linux Kernel: default ISO kernel for 0.9.2.
# Seeded 7.2.6-lcos19 on 2026-10-09 CT (lunduke-linux-kernel master b008279e,
# PR #13, tag 7.2.6-lcos19); see config/packages.chroot/SEED-llk-7.2.6-lcos19.txt.
# Replaced lcos18 (moved to config/packages.chroot/superseded/).
